# Keep the build context small and the image clean.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/dist

# Never bake local state or secrets into the image
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
packages/db/local.db
packages/db/local.db-shm
packages/db/local.db-wal
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
**/var
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.playwright
**/.playwright

# Local-only artifacts (huge, regenerated any time)
**/.artifacts
**/.wrangler
**/.astro
# Derived responsive variants: up to 85 files (84 derivatives plus manifest.json),
# and on a restored machine the derivatives
# are derivatives of REAL private photos. `prebuild` regenerates them inside the
# image from whatever masters the context carries, so shipping them is both
# bloat and a leak of private media into the build context and its cache.
**/public/generated
.agents
.pi
skills-lock.json
bts.jsonc
.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
/originals
